  <item>
    <title>22 夏日走过山间的童年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669fe63b7349f7a5570c4d87</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669fe63b7349f7a5570c4d87</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Jul 2024 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>赏味期限是一档不定期掉落的闲聊播客，播客内容包括但不仅限于两位主播的日常生活、缺德吐槽，以及偶尔的脱口秀表演。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是一期夏日限定节目，不聊不知道，聊完才发现两位主播的童年差别还挺大？欢迎给我们留言，分享你的夏日回忆！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>@蓝莓猫罐头</span></p><span></span><p><span>@十一点吃饭</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期你将会听到】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>十一对本节目的定位其实很不严肃</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>每一个路灯都是飞虫聚集器</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>点蜡烛打扑克vs用应急灯写作业</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>山的脚踝</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>下过雨之后的小鸟都是好小鸟！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>台风过后的to-do list</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>不能出门的童年成为了死宅预备役</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>草席/凉席/麻将席</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>「凉风洞」的记忆</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>蓝：我好像没有家里钥匙</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>十一：我们家不关门</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>暑假和4399和水</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>原来《我的暑假》就是十一的童年生活</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>暑期限定的蜡笔小新</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>租书店的漫画启蒙</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>童年雪糕届的白月光</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>两个现役阿宅相反的成长轨迹</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>户外防暑小技巧</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>难道蓝蓝是星露谷的npc？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>夏日的地狱温泉之旅</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>十一小时候是大自然的孩子</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>你们城里小孩都不野炊吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>水上乐园vs硬核漂流</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmG70t9Zrz6jpkEhVwiOTqMpdpAN.m4a" length="66073348" type="audio/mp4"/>
